flowchart TD
    Regular["OME image levels + live factors"] -->|recover native placement| Pieces["Pieces grouped by factor"]
    Tiles["tiles + placement metadata"] -->|filter scene, axes, channel| Pieces
    Pieces -->|bound finest level| Extent["Common native extent"]
    Extent -->|size each level| Mosaic["Mosaic + spatial bins"]
    Mosaic -->|build without pixel reads| Dask["Lazy Dask pyramid"]
    Dask -->|request output chunk| Candidates["Intersecting pieces"]
    Candidates -->|map centres to samples| Read["Bounded Zarr reads"]
    Read -->|overwrite in source order| Output["Composed output chunk"]
